", ``LED_GREEN`` e ``LED_BLUE``\\ ::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m7.rst:144
msgid ""
"**IR LEDs** — both LEDs are driven together through the ``LED_IR`` pin. "
"``LED_IR`` is wired **active high** in hardware while the firmware treats "
"every other on‑board LED as active low, so use :meth:`~machine.Pin.low` / "
":meth:`~machine.Pin.high` rather than :meth:`~machine.LED.on` / "
":meth:`~machine.LED.off` (which would invert the sense)::"
msgstr ""
"**LED IR** — entrambi i LED sono pilotati insieme attraverso il pin "
"``LED_IR``\\ . ``LED_IR`` è cablato **attivo alto** in hardware mentre il "
"firmware tratta ogni altro LED a bordo come attivo basso, quindi usa "
":meth:`~machine.Pin.low` / :meth:`~machine.Pin.high` invece di "
":meth:`~machine.LED.on` / :meth:`~machine.LED.off` (che invertirebbero il "
"senso)::"

